    <!-- Floor-draping tablecloths + small warm table lamps on each dining table,
         for atmosphere (replaces the removed bar-counter pendants). Desaturated
         cloth + emissive lamp shade => detector-safe. Lamps at a back corner so
         the table centre stays clear for serving. No collision. -->
